"},"comments":4,"created_at":"2026-04-19T10:12:59Z","updated_at":"2026-06-11T20:29:20Z","closed_at":"2026-06-11T20:29:20Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nv4.7.dev5.official [a8643700c]\n\n### System information\n\nWindows11 - Godot Engine v4.7.dev5.official.a8643700c - D3D12 12_0 - Forward+ - Using Device #0: NVIDIA - NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3060 - CPU : Intel(R) UHD Graphics 770 \n\n### Issue description\n\nThere are two ways to trigger this bug:\n\nFirst method: Right after creating a GPUParticles3D node in the scene for the first time, simply moving the node triggers the bug.\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c8e9ea56-f82b-42e4-9c07-a3eabbc69614\n\nSecond method: Adding a GPUParticles3D node as a child to a parent node that has already been moved also triggers the bug. Moreover, if you then move the already-bugged GPUParticles3D node, its rendered shape becomes even more distorted.\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/94d71915-65bf-4ddb-b1ff-8992dbeed900\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nMethod 1:  \nCreate a GPUParticles3D node in the scene.  \nAssign a simple process material and set up a Draw Pass: Pass 1 → BoxMesh.  \nMove the node in the scene—especially along the Y-axis.  \n   → The bug occurs immediately.\n\nMethod 2:  \nCreate a GPUParticles3D node as a child of a parent node that has already been moved from its original position.  \nAssign a simple process material and set up a Draw Pass: Pass 1 → BoxMesh.  \n   → The bug is triggered upon creation.\n\n\nOnce the bug is triggered, unchecking and then re-checking the Emitting property restores the correct shape temporarily.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[test-particles.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/26866871/test-particles.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118746/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118746/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}